{"title": "Bihar's JD(U) Opposes Uniform Civil Code Implementation", "summary": "The Janata Dal (United) party in Bihar has stated its opposition to the implementation of the Uniform Civil Code (UCC) within the state. Senior JD(U) leader and former Minister Shyam Rajak announced that the UCC will not be implemented in Bihar \"at any cost.\" This stance comes despite the party having previously supported the UCC Bill in Parliament. The development highlights a potential rift within the National Democratic Alliance (NDA) regarding the UCC's application in Bihar.", "summary_points": ["JD(U) leader Shyam Rajak stated the Uniform Civil Code will not be implemented in Bihar.", "Rajak said the UCC will not be implemented \"at any cost\" in Bihar.", "The JD(U) previously supported the UCC Bill in Parliament.", "The opposition to implementation in Bihar suggests a rift within the NDA."], "title_hi": "बिहार में यूनिफॉर्म सिविल कोड (UCC) के कार्यान्वयन का JD(U) ने किया विरोध", "summary_hi": "बिहार में जनता दल (यूनाइटेड) पार्टी ने राज्य में यूनिफॉर्म सिविल कोड (UCC) के कार्यान्वयन का विरोध करने की घोषणा की है। वरिष्ठ जद(यू) नेता और पूर्व मंत्री श्याम रजक ने कहा कि बिहार में यूसीसी को \"किसी भी कीमत पर\" लागू नहीं किया जाएगा। यह रुख ऐसे समय आया है जब पार्टी ने पहले संसद में यूसीसी विधेयक का समर्थन किया था। यह घटनाक्रम बिहार में यूसीसी के अनुप्रयोग को लेकर राष्ट्रीय जनतांत्रिक गठबंधन (NDA) के भीतर एक संभावित दरार को उजागर करता है।", "summary_points_hi": ["जद(यू) नेता श्याम रजक ने कहा कि यूनिफॉर्म सिविल कोड बिहार में लागू नहीं किया जाएगा।", "रजक ने कहा कि यूसीसी को बिहार में \"किसी भी कीमत पर\" लागू नहीं किया जाएगा।", "जद(यू) ने पहले संसद में यूसीसी विधेयक का समर्थन किया था।", "बिहार में कार्यान्वयन के विरोध से एनडीए के भीतर एक दरार का संकेत मिलता है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Frames the issue as a rift within the NDA over UCC implementation in Bihar."], "center": ["Highlights the contradiction between the JD(U)'s parliamentary support for the UCC Bill and its opposition to its implementation in Bihar."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["बिहार में यूसीसी कार्यान्वयन पर एनडीए के भीतर एक दरार के रूप में मुद्दे को प्रस्तुत करता है।"], "center": ["यूसीसी विधेयक के लिए जद(यू) के संसदीय समर्थन और बिहार में इसके कार्यान्वयन के विरोध के बीच विरोधाभास को उजागर करता है।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134242798,imgsize-977942.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bihar/rift-within-nda-over-implementation-of-ucc-in-bihar/article71466095.ece", "headline": "Rift within NDA over implementation of UCC in Bihar"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ucc-in-bihar-or-not-jdu-opposes-implementation-despite-backing-bill-in-parliament/articleshow/134242675.cms", "headline": "UCC in Bihar? JD(U) opposes implementation despite backing Bill in Parliament"}, {"source": "The New Indian Express", "owner": "The New Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Bring UCC Bill in Parliament if you have numbers: J&K CM Omar Abdullah to BJP"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Omar hits back at LoP, says BJP’s two-day Assembly demand shows ‘non-seriousness’"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Omar Abdullah: UCC must be decided by Parliament, not individual states"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "LoP Sharma calls for 30-day Assembly session, says J&K govt has made legislature a ‘joke’"}, {"source": "Gr